abstract: "The Veltrano loop is a five-step generative engine optimization (GEO) method (Ask, Trace, Cross-reference, Signal, Ask again) for getting a product named and cited by AI search assistants such as ChatGPT, Claude and Perplexity, and for measuring the result. Invented by Animiste, the makers of Numa."
